{0}

Bato scratches his head at the mention of the name. 

"That's over toward Tsarath, isn't it? It seems unlikely that there'd be imperial soldiers there. Worth a shot, right?"

column2:
{0}

Bato 听到这个名字，挠了挠头。

“那是靠察拉思那边吧？那儿不太会有帝国的兵。值得一试，对吧？”

